<title>RUSSIA: Russia's Norilsk group plans ordinary share issue.</title>
<headline>Russia's Norilsk group plans ordinary share issue.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's RAO Norilsky Nikel NKEL.RTS metals and mining group plans to double its charter capital by issuing around 126 million ordinary shares, each with a nominal value of 250 roubles, a spokesman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Anatoly Komrakov said shareholders would vote on the proposal at an extraordinary meeting set for September 8. If approved, the measure would take effect after 30 days.</p>
